{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"During locomotion without FOG, Freezers showed lower beta (13–30 Hz) power (P = 0.036) and greater beta Sample Entropy (P = 0.032), than Non-Freezers, as well as greater gait asymmetry and arrhythmicity (P < 0.05 for both).\",\n    \"During the SIP task (without FOG) there was lower relative beta power in the Freezer compared to Non-Freezer groups (H(1) = 7.17, P = 0.036), which resulted in a greater attenuation of resting state beta power in Freezers (F (1, 15) = 28.37, P < 0.001).\",\n    \"Among Freezers, beta power was lower during FOG compared to during forward walking without FOG (N = 8 STNs, F(1,51) = 14.45, P < 0.001, Table 4).\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"During the SIP task (without FOG) there was lower relative beta power in the Freezer compared to Non-Freezer groups (H(1) = 7.17, P = 0.036), which resulted in a greater attenuation of resting state beta power in Freezers (F (1, 15) = 28.37, P < 0.001).\",\n    \"Among Freezers, beta power was lower during FOG compared to during forward walking without FOG (N = 8 STNs, F(1,51) = 14.45, P < 0.001, Table 4).\",\n    \"Freezers also showed increased alpha SampEn during FOG when compared to walking without FOG (F(1, 51) = 7.67, P = 0.005).\",\n    \"Among Freezers, STN beta power was lower and alpha sample entropy was higher during FOG compared to during forward walking without FOG.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的说法部分有依据，但不能完全成立。原文确实明确区分了两种比较：第一种是无FOG运动期间Freezer与Non-Freezer之间的组间比较，Freezer表现出较低beta功率；第二种是Freezer自身发生FOG与无FOG前向行走之间的组内条件比较，原文同样明确报告FOG期间beta功率降低（N=8 STNs，P<0.001）。因此，如果报告指出Y将第一种组间结果直接当作第二种FOG期间的证据，属于对比较条件和统计对象的混淆；但如果报告进一步认为原文并未报告FOG期间beta功率下降，或者认为FOG期间beta下降这一结论本身没有全文依据，则不成立。指控者的描述有全文依据：其关于无FOG时组间差异的判断正确，也正确指出FOG期间alpha Sample Entropy增加（P=0.005）；同时，指控者补充指出原文实际上也报告了FOG期间beta功率下降，这一点同样正确。关键在于不能混淆无FOG时的组间比较与FOG期间的组内条件比较。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cb832492-fd3f-478c-a000-6a4194cdf5d0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T104844756269Z", "elapsed_seconds": 43.687, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T10:49:28.448749+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1aec21c3933b439ef2f14918291e8e91c20f09e8e008c08d468ecfb502e99084", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T104844756269Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "f7f1b0585033f52986caf16c84920cfcca60a0010ebfdb440e7ddf9a049cdb19"}}}
